    20	#      distant blue endpoint means those two blues must be connected, even if other blue
    21	#      endpoints are closer in raw geometry. Magenta pixels on the interior of that
    22	#      diagonal still emit perpendicular magenta rays exactly as before.
    23	#    - Flow difference on a small example:
